# Retire policy 2026-11-20: still in production in 2026 with no announced end; retire dates commented out. Revisit when an end is announced.
# Bentley Continental GT fourth generation, 2024 onwards.
#
# The 2024 car: the single-oval headlamp face, the wider track and the
# 4.0-litre V8 plug-in hybrid powertrain with the 25.9 kWh battery, which is
# NOT a V6. Production and deliveries began in the third quarter of 2024.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bentley_Continental_GT
#
# Dimensions 4.895 x 1.966 x 1.397 m, wheelbase 2.851 m, with 2.187 m over
# the mirrors (Bentley's fourth-generation specification sheet).
#
# Shape reference: NO true level side elevation exists, either on Commons or
# in Bentley's 30-image launch gallery. Image 1 is about 25-30 degrees off
# square-on, so the flank is estimated and the limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (a) for Tourmaline Green, the launch colour, and Gravity
# Grey; Beluga and Glacier White are carried over from the third-generation
# palette and are only grade (c) until a fourth-generation UK brochure is
# read. Weights 20, 16, 12, 10, total 58, provisional.
#
# Speed 335 km/h. Comfort 165/578, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 165. Classes 3,4.
# Dates: intro July 2024, the start of production and deliveries; retire dates
# commented out (still in production in 2026).
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bentley-continental-gt-4.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/bentley-continental-gt-4.dae. References:
# citycars/references/bentley-continental-gt-4/ (gitignored).
#
# Accepted deviations: the 4.0-litre V8 plug-in hybrid, not a V6. No true side
# elevation exists, so the flank and the overhang split are estimates
# constrained to the published dimensions. The lamp and diffuser detail is
# simplified. The mirror span is 2.187 m.


obj=citycar
name=BentleyContinentalGT4(TourmalineGreen)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=20
intro_year=2024
intro_month=7
#retire_year=2046
#retire_month=6
speed=335
length=3
class=3,4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=165
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=578

Image[E]=./images/bentley-continental-gt-4-tourmalinegreen_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/bentley-continental-gt-4-tourmalinegreen_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/bentley-continental-gt-4-tourmalinegreen_S.0.0,0,0
Image[SW]=./images/bentley-continental-gt-4-tourmalinegreen_SW.0.0,-8,10
